metadata/design_notes = "A code freeze: two tight grids of blocks, one each side, with single-tile gaps between them. A gap is sixteen pixels against a robot ten across, so it is passable and nothing more, and a fight that drifts into a grid is a fight at walking pace. The open floor between the grids is where the player wants to be and where two of the enemies start."
